WEBVTT

00:00:06.760 --> 00:00:08.520
An aradama using utsushi?

00:00:08.520 --> 00:00:12.900
The elite guard members were using 
it, too, so it's not that surprising.

00:00:16.750 --> 00:00:18.230
Incredible...

00:00:18.230 --> 00:00:20.950
She deflected a strike from 
the Storm Armor one-handed?

00:00:22.350 --> 00:00:25.280
I guess you could say that 
equipment did acceptably

00:00:25.280 --> 00:00:29.040
if it fought against my vanguard, 
which was my armor and

00:00:29.040 --> 00:00:31.150
the elite guard carrying aradama.

00:00:32.270 --> 00:00:33.700
How delightful.

00:00:33.700 --> 00:00:34.910
What?!

00:00:35.750 --> 00:00:38.210
It shall be a relief from this tedium.

00:00:38.210 --> 00:00:42.840
I will fulfill the duty 
my mother left behind!

00:00:43.210 --> 00:00:44.550
You can try.

00:00:44.550 --> 00:00:48.390
One last thing. Are you Origami Yukari?

00:00:48.390 --> 00:00:50.690
Or are you Princess Tagitsu?

00:00:51.160 --> 00:00:53.730
Do you have time to converse?

00:00:56.610 --> 00:00:59.590
Kanami, hit her with everything you've got!

00:00:59.590 --> 00:01:00.410
Right!

00:01:09.120 --> 00:01:19.420
<b>Katana Maidens</b>

00:02:31.200 --> 00:02:36.620
<b>Episode 12  A Single Sword</b>

00:02:41.880 --> 00:02:42.880
Nene?

00:02:44.330 --> 00:02:45.420
Damn it...

00:02:47.350 --> 00:02:48.970
Hey, Ellen.

00:02:51.800 --> 00:02:53.210
She's dead, huh?

00:02:53.950 --> 00:02:56.390
Please don't just kill me off.

00:02:57.110 --> 00:02:59.020
That brat isn't here.

00:02:59.960 --> 00:03:02.970
We did dish out as much as we took...

00:03:06.240 --> 00:03:09.120
That's where the great aradama is, isn't it?

00:03:09.120 --> 00:03:11.780
If Hiyori and Kanami defeat her,
 things will be a lot easier.

00:03:12.360 --> 00:03:15.620
We only have a little while left until
 we hit our equipment's time limit.

00:03:15.620 --> 00:03:16.880
What should we do?

00:03:17.270 --> 00:03:19.610
We've taken a real beating.

00:03:20.540 --> 00:03:23.580
Even if we went to join them,
 we wouldn't be able to contribute much.

00:03:23.580 --> 00:03:27.300
I'd really like to just take a nap right now.

00:03:27.800 --> 00:03:31.800
But we're still going to go.
 That's what heroes do.

00:03:34.680 --> 00:03:36.240
I'm with you!

00:03:41.760 --> 00:03:45.360
After losing that much blood,
 you should be dead.

00:03:45.360 --> 00:03:48.690
You are the ones who will be finished first.

00:03:48.690 --> 00:03:49.760
Keep going.

00:03:49.760 --> 00:03:51.620
They should be nearing
 their operational limit.

00:03:52.490 --> 00:03:56.620
Sayaka-chan, I need you to hold 
back the aradama for a bit.

00:03:57.240 --> 00:03:59.090
I will cut her down.

00:03:59.560 --> 00:04:00.650
Understood.

00:04:01.850 --> 00:04:05.630
I will use this power as I see fit.

00:04:16.940 --> 00:04:19.810
<i>This is Origami Yukari's Niten Ichi style?</i>

00:04:20.130 --> 00:04:22.080
You don't have time to hesitate!

00:04:22.080 --> 00:04:24.190
Kanami, the next attack will settle this!

00:04:24.190 --> 00:04:25.110
Got it!

00:04:45.270 --> 00:04:46.380
Finished?

00:04:46.380 --> 00:04:47.500
Hiyori-chan!

00:04:49.430 --> 00:04:50.740
Hiyori-chan...

00:04:50.740 --> 00:04:54.090
Why was she able to fend 
off our attack just now?

00:04:54.570 --> 00:04:57.720
Is she completely predicting 
our sword movements?

00:04:58.080 --> 00:05:03.560
Yes, I can see right through everything.

00:05:09.290 --> 00:05:10.570
Sayaka...

00:05:21.020 --> 00:05:22.590
Well done.

00:05:30.070 --> 00:05:31.510
Sayaka!

00:05:31.980 --> 00:05:34.130
You would dare point Muramasa at me?

00:05:36.350 --> 00:05:37.580
Sayaka-chan!

00:05:39.870 --> 00:05:40.850
It's hot.

00:05:42.440 --> 00:05:45.050
My hands, which received 
Kanami's sword, are hot.

00:05:45.900 --> 00:05:48.570
My shoulders, which Mai hugged, are hot.

00:05:49.370 --> 00:05:54.070
But when I point my okatana 
at you, my chest aches.

00:05:54.910 --> 00:05:56.450
Sayaka-chan...

00:05:59.480 --> 00:06:03.430
So even a doll like you 
had feelings like that.

00:06:03.430 --> 00:06:05.830
No, perhaps they sprouted?

00:06:06.730 --> 00:06:09.840
Fine, Sayaka. I will teach you...

00:06:09.840 --> 00:06:13.120
how to remove that pain.

00:06:13.590 --> 00:06:15.860
Beg me for forgiveness.

00:06:15.860 --> 00:06:18.160
Then I will teach you how get 
rid of such unnecessary—

00:06:18.160 --> 00:06:19.170
...get it.

00:06:20.220 --> 00:06:21.450
You don't get it.

00:06:22.310 --> 00:06:25.690
The pain I feel is because I pity you.

00:06:29.740 --> 00:06:32.110
Let's hurry and catch up 
with Kanami and Hiyori.

00:06:32.590 --> 00:06:33.390
Okay.

00:06:38.970 --> 00:06:40.700
Sayaka...

00:06:53.260 --> 00:06:57.630
Go on ahead to Yukari-sama, Maki-san.

00:06:58.830 --> 00:07:02.960
Unfortunately, I no longer 
have the strength to fight.

00:07:03.650 --> 00:07:06.480
I will deal with Yume's remains.

00:07:06.480 --> 00:07:07.840
Deal with?

00:07:07.840 --> 00:07:11.450
She will turn into an 
aradama if left like that.

00:07:11.870 --> 00:07:12.900
That's right.

00:07:13.480 --> 00:07:15.310
Yume would once again...

00:07:15.310 --> 00:07:16.190
Maki-san!

00:07:16.610 --> 00:07:20.650
You understand, don't you? 
That is no longer Yume.

00:07:21.880 --> 00:07:25.210
It is an aradama that's just
using Yume as a vessel.

00:07:25.870 --> 00:07:29.540
Then we would have to kill Yume once more.

00:07:30.490 --> 00:07:32.930
I will take care of her.

00:07:32.930 --> 00:07:34.880
It would be too hard for you.

00:07:35.740 --> 00:07:41.010
So we are not even permitted a normal death?

00:07:41.740 --> 00:07:44.350
We were prepared for that from the start.

00:07:45.350 --> 00:07:47.570
Ever since we accepted the aradama.

00:07:48.270 --> 00:07:52.400
Now, go! First member of the elite guard!

00:08:03.990 --> 00:08:06.820
My eyes see through everything.

00:08:06.820 --> 00:08:11.330
Your physical abilities,
your latent powers, your thoughts...

00:08:11.930 --> 00:08:14.370
I see through every single possibility

00:08:14.370 --> 00:08:17.280
and I decide on the best move from there.

00:08:17.870 --> 00:08:20.090
I will answer your question from earlier.

00:08:21.030 --> 00:08:23.050
I am Princess Tagitsu.

00:08:31.230 --> 00:08:32.980
Can she really see through things?

00:08:32.980 --> 00:08:34.980
We have no choice but to believe her!

00:08:35.540 --> 00:08:39.650
That's right, the reason she was able 
to deflect my single sword was—

00:08:39.650 --> 00:08:42.790
Yes, I could see everything.

00:08:42.790 --> 00:08:45.560
It would have been so simple to kill you,

00:08:45.560 --> 00:08:47.410
but I released you on purpose.

00:08:47.990 --> 00:08:53.360
As a result, you pulled all the strings,
 and Mokusa was destroyed.

00:08:53.790 --> 00:08:57.670
And now you have returned 
so that I can kill you.

00:08:58.690 --> 00:08:59.760
Curse you!

00:08:59.760 --> 00:09:00.550
No!

00:09:02.010 --> 00:09:02.970
I can see it.

00:09:05.430 --> 00:09:06.430
Wh-What are you—?!

00:09:09.110 --> 00:09:11.100
<i>She didn't see my attack just now?</i>

00:09:11.100 --> 00:09:12.220
Get back, Kanami!

00:09:13.150 --> 00:09:14.170
<i>Then...</i>

00:09:22.240 --> 00:09:24.090
<i>No, that won't work.</i>

00:09:26.870 --> 00:09:28.580
Why isn't she attacking?

00:09:30.200 --> 00:09:32.080
<i>She's seeing too much.</i>

00:09:32.590 --> 00:09:36.210
<i>If I strike, she can narrow 
down what follows to an extent.</i>

00:09:36.580 --> 00:09:39.760
<i>But in this state, she can 
see too many possibilities</i>

00:09:39.760 --> 00:09:41.470
<i>and can't decide what to do.</i>

00:09:55.150 --> 00:09:56.500
I see.

00:09:56.500 --> 00:10:00.490
It seems any further calculations 
will be difficult for this vessel.

00:10:00.490 --> 00:10:01.490
However—

00:10:08.090 --> 00:10:09.490
<i>Chidori!</i>

00:10:16.580 --> 00:10:18.910
Chidori and Kogarasumaru.

00:10:19.590 --> 00:10:23.350
I did not think there would 
be anyone in the present day

00:10:23.350 --> 00:10:25.250
like both Fujiwara Minato and Hiiragi Kagari.

00:10:26.060 --> 00:10:28.450
The same quality as us.

00:10:29.270 --> 00:10:32.060
Why did I not see that possibility?

00:10:32.990 --> 00:10:33.980
That is it!

00:10:36.660 --> 00:10:37.840
Yukari!

00:10:38.920 --> 00:10:39.730
Attack!

00:10:40.310 --> 00:10:40.900
What?!

00:10:40.900 --> 00:10:42.940
Attack me with your okatana!

00:10:54.390 --> 00:10:56.000
This is just like that other time!

00:11:00.530 --> 00:11:02.650
Akane-sama, it's happening again.

00:11:03.270 --> 00:11:04.400
Nee-sama...

00:11:16.410 --> 00:11:18.850
A... demon?

00:11:49.640 --> 00:11:51.260
Sayaka-chan!

00:11:53.010 --> 00:11:54.970
The next wave is coming! Hiyori-chan!

00:12:03.860 --> 00:12:05.090
Retreat!

00:12:06.740 --> 00:12:08.070
I'm sorry.

00:12:08.070 --> 00:12:09.070
It's fine.

00:12:09.480 --> 00:12:12.570
For the first time, I'm scared.

00:12:12.570 --> 00:12:13.740
Me, too.

00:12:14.330 --> 00:12:16.220
She probably is, too.

00:12:24.630 --> 00:12:26.380
I have to be sure...

00:12:35.430 --> 00:12:36.640
Impossible!

00:12:36.640 --> 00:12:38.590
There was this much noro here...

00:12:38.590 --> 00:12:40.640
Have you finally accepted the situation, then?

00:12:41.430 --> 00:12:43.360
What is this place?

00:12:43.360 --> 00:12:46.610
The storehouse for all the noro 
the Origami family collected.

00:12:46.880 --> 00:12:51.820
Up until a few hours ago, 
twenty years' worth of noro was here.

00:12:52.300 --> 00:12:56.830
So then they combined it all 
and revived the monster?

00:12:57.120 --> 00:13:00.030
Noro doesn't become a spectrum if 
you keep applying electric current

00:13:00.030 --> 00:13:02.230
according to its wavelength.

00:13:02.230 --> 00:13:04.720
It can be managed more steadily 
than by offering it in various places

00:13:04.720 --> 00:13:06.500
in small quantities.

00:13:06.500 --> 00:13:08.710
Unfortunately, that is a lie.

00:13:08.710 --> 00:13:11.190
The noro was only pretending to be dormant

00:13:11.190 --> 00:13:13.680
under Princess Tagitsu's control.

00:13:14.750 --> 00:13:17.890
Which means this country has been 
deceived by her for twenty years,

00:13:17.890 --> 00:13:20.600
all while diligently collecting noro.

00:13:21.010 --> 00:13:22.480
Take responsibility.

00:13:22.940 --> 00:13:26.180
But accidents involving 
aradama have decreased

00:13:26.180 --> 00:13:28.500
ever since the Origami family 
started managing the noro.

00:13:28.500 --> 00:13:30.250
Along with the numbers of dead Toji.

00:13:30.710 --> 00:13:33.240
All an act put on while
 preparing for this day.

00:13:33.240 --> 00:13:35.870
The aradama, which is the embodiment 
of impurity, won't die

00:13:35.870 --> 00:13:37.990
even if it is exterminated again and again.

00:13:38.400 --> 00:13:41.650
Equivalent power is necessary to compete.

00:13:41.650 --> 00:13:45.460
All you can do is fight poison with poison,
 and impurity with impurity—

00:13:45.460 --> 00:13:48.000
Is that the reason why you
 accepted the aradama?

00:13:48.000 --> 00:13:50.080
The point is, you're just scared.

00:13:50.080 --> 00:13:50.760
What?!

00:13:51.110 --> 00:13:54.000
Aradama are hated for being impure

00:13:54.000 --> 00:13:56.930
due to the fears of those like you.

00:14:08.170 --> 00:14:09.320
Yukari-sama?

00:14:09.790 --> 00:14:11.610
No, that's...

00:14:15.230 --> 00:14:16.170
Wait!

00:14:22.830 --> 00:14:24.830
Kaoru-chan! Ellen-chan!

00:14:28.530 --> 00:14:30.140
The enemy is using six-sword style.

00:14:30.140 --> 00:14:32.910
That is just perfect for the six of us!

00:14:35.050 --> 00:14:37.070
Kanami-chan, hold back a moment!

00:14:37.070 --> 00:14:38.390
Ellen-chan, behind you!

00:14:52.900 --> 00:14:55.030
Kaoru-chan, don't get too close!

00:14:57.490 --> 00:14:58.780
Mai!

00:15:00.280 --> 00:15:01.990
Mai-chan! Sayaka-chan!

00:15:17.630 --> 00:15:22.400
<i>Should I use it? The same 
secret technique as my mother?</i>

00:15:22.400 --> 00:15:24.390
I am the god of evil.

00:15:33.600 --> 00:15:36.180
Yukari-sama, please give me the order...

00:15:36.180 --> 00:15:37.610
To fulfill my duty.

00:15:37.610 --> 00:15:38.890
Your duty?

00:15:39.340 --> 00:15:40.370
Yukari-sama!

00:15:41.420 --> 00:15:42.870
Please, Kagari.

00:15:44.060 --> 00:15:46.120
Seal Princess Tagitsu.

00:15:46.120 --> 00:15:47.090
Yes, ma'am.

00:15:47.090 --> 00:15:48.150
Hey, now!

00:15:48.150 --> 00:15:51.440
I am sorry you had to make 
such a painful decision.

00:15:52.730 --> 00:15:57.720
The school days I spent with everyone 
are my priceless treasures.

00:15:58.200 --> 00:16:02.690
Minato-senpai, I honestly 
struggled with you sometimes,

00:16:02.690 --> 00:16:05.830
but I am very, very grateful to you.

00:16:05.830 --> 00:16:07.100
Kagari?

00:16:07.430 --> 00:16:10.210
Princess Tagitsu! I will seal you away!

00:16:10.620 --> 00:16:13.110
That is why I am here!

00:16:14.590 --> 00:16:15.360
Kagari!

00:16:24.110 --> 00:16:25.370
Minato!

00:16:25.370 --> 00:16:27.500
Minato!

00:16:37.260 --> 00:16:40.630
Minato-senpai?! No! Not you, too!

00:16:40.630 --> 00:16:43.060
I will <i>not</i> give you up!

00:16:51.390 --> 00:16:55.320
Kagari... Minato... What have I...

00:17:00.480 --> 00:17:02.660
Origami Yukari...

00:17:02.660 --> 00:17:05.520
I have a proposal for you.

00:17:07.030 --> 00:17:13.770
I found myself awakened in 
a cold, dark storehouse.

00:17:14.650 --> 00:17:18.510
At first, there was a sense of loss.

00:17:19.210 --> 00:17:22.070
The feeling that a part 
of me was ripped away,

00:17:22.070 --> 00:17:25.760
something precious was stolen,

00:17:25.760 --> 00:17:28.830
and the urge to get it back...

00:17:28.830 --> 00:17:32.060
It was like a hunger.

00:17:32.690 --> 00:17:36.380
Eventually, I became a massive god of evil.

00:17:36.380 --> 00:17:41.790
It was then that revenge 
became my motivation.

00:17:43.110 --> 00:17:48.780
While scattering the worst,
 my intelligence continued to evolve.

00:17:49.240 --> 00:17:52.750
Soon I predicted one conclusion.

00:17:53.190 --> 00:17:55.750
I, who had changed into a god of evil,

00:17:55.750 --> 00:17:59.810
would one day be destroyed by human hands.

00:18:00.270 --> 00:18:03.750
I sought for a way to survive.

00:18:03.750 --> 00:18:07.010
It just needs to be carried out.

00:18:07.010 --> 00:18:08.300
No...

00:18:08.790 --> 00:18:12.750
Containing Enoshima and sending 
in the special military unit...

00:18:12.750 --> 00:18:15.840
You are correct, Origami Yukari.

00:18:15.840 --> 00:18:19.890
It was all merely a show to lure you out.

00:18:19.890 --> 00:18:23.900
Then what about Kagari and Minato?

00:18:24.290 --> 00:18:26.240
Fuse with me.

00:18:26.240 --> 00:18:31.520
Do so and the lives of Fujiwara Minato 
and Hiiragi Kagari will be saved.

00:18:32.160 --> 00:18:34.510
I will fuse with you,

00:18:34.510 --> 00:18:38.480
hide in the shallows of the netherworld,
 and heal my wounds.

00:18:38.480 --> 00:18:42.180
I will grant you a grace
period of a few decades.

00:18:42.180 --> 00:18:46.850
If you can destroy me in
 that time, then you will win.

00:18:46.850 --> 00:18:49.010
Why would I agree to such a foolish proposal?

00:18:49.010 --> 00:18:52.160
You have already made your decision.

00:18:53.750 --> 00:18:57.190
It is an Origami family duty that 
has been continuously passed down.

00:18:57.600 --> 00:19:01.070
However, Yukari chose their survival.

00:19:06.400 --> 00:19:07.630
K-Kanami!

00:19:08.040 --> 00:19:12.190
You are good, but you're 
no match for your mother.

00:19:15.000 --> 00:19:16.640
Mother...

00:19:19.070 --> 00:19:21.780
Now, what will you do?

00:19:21.780 --> 00:19:24.470
Will you use the same secret 
technique as your mother?

00:19:24.470 --> 00:19:28.050
That's if you can pierce me 
with that okatana, of course.

00:19:29.870 --> 00:19:33.270
Your sword cannot reach me.

00:19:33.270 --> 00:19:36.270
There is no Toji in this world 
that surpasses Origami Yukari.

00:19:39.190 --> 00:19:41.770
Yukari, long time no see!

00:19:42.470 --> 00:19:43.480
Minato?

00:19:45.510 --> 00:19:46.780
Kanami?

00:19:46.780 --> 00:19:48.330
Impossible.

00:19:56.490 --> 00:19:57.670
Impossible.

00:19:57.670 --> 00:19:58.960
Totally possible!

00:19:59.830 --> 00:20:00.960
Kanami?

00:20:02.860 --> 00:20:04.590
Impossible.

00:20:04.590 --> 00:20:07.880
Fujiwara Minato is dead!

00:20:09.930 --> 00:20:11.340
Apparently so.

00:20:11.910 --> 00:20:14.070
This future should not exist.

00:20:14.070 --> 00:20:16.220
And yet here we are!

00:20:23.820 --> 00:20:24.960
Kanami!

00:21:41.170 --> 00:21:44.100
This is my true, single sword!

00:21:44.990 --> 00:21:46.230
Well done.

00:21:46.230 --> 00:21:50.070
You will descend along with me to 
the depths of the netherworld!

00:22:00.410 --> 00:22:02.160
Don't do it, Hiyori-chan!

00:22:11.270 --> 00:22:13.130
<i>Princess Tagitsu is...?</i>

00:23:34.800 --> 00:23:39.800
<b>Katana Maidens</b>

00:23:34.800 --> 00:23:39.800
<b>Next time, we'll be airing the digest episode "Katana Maidens ~ Toji no Miko Short Version (Episodes 1~12)"</b>
